  "worked_solution": "The rate of change in the volume of water in the tank per hour increases in proportion to $t$ and decreases by $200.$ The differential equation that describes this is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t}=kt-200,\n$$\n\nwhere $k$ is the (positive) constant of proportionality.",
